INDUSTRIAL PRESSURE GAUGES  
620.1127 (pressure‑measuring instruments)
9 TYPES OF PRESSURE GAUGES FOR INDUSTRY             

 Pressure gauges are critical measurement tools in the        
 industrial sector, acting as “warning signals” when          
 pressure exceeds safe limits. Below are the most             
 commonly used types of pressure gauges in the industry.      

  1. Process Pressure Gauge                                   
  2. Diaphragm Gauge                                          
  3. Differential Gauge                                       
  4. Safety Pattern Gauge                                     
  5. Test Pressure Gauge                                      
  6. Ultrapure Gauge                                          
  7. Rail Pressure Gauge                                      
  8. Subsea/Offshore Gauge                                    
  9. Barton Chart Recorder                                    
